  "body": "<div class=\"white hotels-row\" id=\"hotels\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Recommended Hotels</h2>\n<p>\n<i class=\"fa fa-hotel fa-4x\"></i>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Ibis Sydney on Darling Harbour</h3>\n<p>\n70 Murray Street, Darling Harbour, PYRMONT, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-293\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-1757-ibis-sydney-darling-harbour/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Amora Hotel Jamison</h3>\n<p>\n11 Jamison Street, Sydney, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-295\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.amorahotels.com/hotels/amora-hotel-jamison-sydney\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Novotel Sydney Central</h3>\n<p>\n169 179 Thomas Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-296\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-8781-novotel-sydney-central/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Novotel Rockford Darling Harbour</h3>\n<p>\n17 Little Pier Street, DARLING HARBOUR, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-297\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-3021-novotel-sydney-rockford-darling-harbour/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Sheraton on the Park</h3>\n<p>\n161 Elizabeth Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-306\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.sheratonontheparksydney.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Swissôtel Sydney</h3>\n<p>\n68 Market Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-298\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.swissotel.com/hotels/sydney/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Hyatt Regency Sydney</h3>\n<p>\n161 Sussex Street, Sydney, AU\n</p>\n<p class=\"summit-location-message\">\nBOOK A (LIMITED SUPPLY) DISCOUNTED ROOM NOW!\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-336\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"https://aws.passkey.com/go/d674d298\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Hilton Sydney</h3>\n<p>\n488 GEORGE STREET, Sydney, NEW SOUTH WALES, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-299\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www3.hilton.com/en/hotels/new-south-wales/hilton-sydney-SYDHITW/index.html?WT.mc_id=zELWAKN0APAC1HI2DMH3LocalSearch4DGGenericx6SYDHITW\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Sofitel Sydney Darling Harbour</h3>\n<p>\n12 Darling Drive, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-300\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.sofitelsydneydarlingharbour.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>The Westin Sydney</h3>\n<p>\n1 Martin Place, Sydney, New South Wales, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-301\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.westinsydney.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Ibis Sydney World Square</h3>\n<p>\n382 -384 Pitt Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-302\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-2132-ibis-sydney-world-square/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Pullman Sydney Hyde Park</h3>\n<p>\n36 College Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-303\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-8763-pullman-sydney-hyde-park/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Mercure Sydney</h3>\n<p>\n818-820 George Street, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-304\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-2073-mercure-sydney/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Ibis Sydney King Street Wharf</h3>\n<p>\n22 Shelley Street, King Street Wharf, Sydney, NSW, AU\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-305\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.accorhotels.com/gb/hotel-6412-ibis-sydney-king-street-wharf/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"white visa-row\" id=\"visa\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-push-2\">\n<h2>Visa Process</h2>\n<h2>How to apply for a Visa</h2>\n<p><strong>All non-Australian residents will need a visa to travel to Australia (including United States citizens)</strong>, however, not everyone will need a visa invitation letter in order to secure their visa so before submitting a request, please check with your local <a href=\"https://www.border.gov.au/about/contact/offices-locations\" target=\"_blank\">Australian Consulate</a>to see if an invitation letter is needed to apply for your visa. <em>Note: there are different requirements based on your country of origin so please check with your local Australian Embassy or Consulate.</em></p>\n<p>To find out what type of Visitor VISA you require to travel to Australia, and if you require a VISA invitation letter, please visit <a href=\"https://www.border.gov.au/Trav/Visa/Appl/Visitor\" target=\"_blank\">this web page</a><em>before</em>filling out the form. If you are still unsure, please check with your local <a href=\"https://www.border.gov.au/about/contact/offices-locations\" target=\"_blank\">Australian Consulate</a>. To request a visa invitation letter, please fill out <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/visa_form_sydney_summit\" target=\"_blank\">this form</a>.</p>\n<p>If you have any questions regarding visas, please email <a href=\"mailto:eventvisa@openstack.org\">eventvisa@openstack.org</a>.</p>\n<h2>Visa Processing Time</h2>\n<p>As a general planning guideline, if a visa is needed, a foreign traveler should apply for his or her visa as soon as possible, preferably no later than <strong>60 days before the travel date</strong>.</p>\n<p>Deadline to submit Visa Invitation Letter request:</p>\n<p>Requests for invitation letters must be received before <strong>October 16, 2017</strong>. We will send your visa letter to the email you provide on <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/visa_form_sydney_summit\" target=\"_blank\">this form</a>. No hard copies will be sent. Visa invitation letters will be issued within 5 - 7 business days after the request has been submitted.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"venue\">\n<div class=\"venue-row tokyo\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/summit-travel-archive/summits/locations/Exhibition-Centre1168x570-thin.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>The Venue</h2>\n<p>\n<strong>Sydney Convention and Exhibition Centre</strong>\n14 Darling Dr<br />\nSydney , NSW 2009\n</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"photo-credit\" href=\"https://flic.kr/p/8rYHEd\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"white city-intro\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<blockquote><span>Venture past Sydney’s Central Business District to where residents live and play, and you’ll discover that the city’s heart is nowhere near the center of town.</span></blockquote>\n<div class=\"testimonial-attribute\"><img alt=\"New York Times on Barcelona\" src=\"/assets/summit-travel-archive/summit/images/nytimes.png\" /><p>New York Times on Sydney</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
